    <string name="developer_body">Built with care by the developer of this app. You can find more of my work here:</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Your data stays on your device. The app has no accounts, no analytics and no ads.\n\nThe only network request it makes is downloading current exchange rates, and no personal data is sent with it.\n\nBackups are files you create and keep yourself.</string>
    <string name="versions_body">1.0.0\n• Credit card, bank and cash accounts\n• Fixed categories with per-category budgets and warnings\n• Savings goals\n• Planned and recurring payments\n• Balance forecast and statistics\n• Online exchange rates (USD, EUR, CHF, IRR)\n• English, German and Persian with Jalali calendar\n• JSON backup and restore</string>
    <string name="attributions_body">Fonts\nOpen Sans and Vazirmatn, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.\n\nIcons\nMaterial Symbols by Google, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Brand logos belong to their respective owners.\n\nExchange rates\nRates provided by open.er-api.com (Exchange Rate API).</string>
